              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebio shibili injelekha waYorodani, elubeka lwamumbo weinjila, okuhenga ewa eliuba liyeelelanga, mushialo shiabaKanaani abamenyanga muAraba tsana, ahahengana naGiligali, enamiruba chiaMore? ",
          "type": "text",
