              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba mwitsa okhwambukha Yorodani okhwinjila okhubukula eshialo eshia OMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe amuheelesia. Mulashibukula, nimumenya mushio; ",
          "type": "text",
